      "text": "Corvale Lakeside holds 30 units at 1.2 per day, giving 26 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale General holds 128 units at 8.9 per day, giving 14 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Both Corvale East and Corvale Lakeside use the same B. Braun product (NDC 00264193310) manufactured by B. Braun Medical Inc.",
      "cites": ["E1", "E5", "E6"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale General also uses a Baxter product (NDC 00338049906) in addition to the B. Braun product.",
      "cites": ["E3", "E4"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Transferring 13 units from Corvale Lakeside to Corvale East would leave Lakeside with 17 units (14 days) and raise East to 44 units (5 days).",
